              <lg xml:id="m-8bd463b5-7707-4ccf-b0a6-81fd7350c2bd">
                <l xml:id="m-12974594-1605-42e9-a720-9dcae087163d" facs="#m-8660956d-98b3-49fe-b1c3-76946d88e9e6" label="text-like">Sexagesima Sunday.</l><l xml:id="m-cd6459af-1099-44ef-a2a6-f8a106e10140" facs="#m-b3c1553a-64f0-417d-820e-70af27a6e167" label="ambiguous">509</l><l xml:id="m-46a057b0-a2df-4792-abc9-d048f7054c90" facs="#m-7aca085f-09de-4039-8487-342db7e55f24" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-ea6cb026-214f-417a-9afc-6f5fe056e5d2" facs="#m-7dfae0b2-6b8c-4c43-bb48-a6bd7f0be178" label="lyrics-like">YUpplices te rogámus, omnípot-l ribus dignánter deservire concéda¬</l><l xml:id="m-a5ef9293-3733-436b-afc2-076fbbb3adc9" facs="#m-c76593d2-1a4a-4dcb-a887-73386d243f85" label="lyrics-like">O ens Deus: ut, quos tuis réficis</l><l xml:id="m-205d921d-3bdc-4611-9ccd-af1d7f20ce3c" facs="#m-bbfd5574-3b86-4236-b9c1-e36adc67261c" label="lyrics-like">Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-4f19d075-eb9a-4e9f-ab43-9eae4682d219" facs="#m-97d4777b-fc54-4e71-a455-12f983fa02c9" label="lyrics-like">sacraméntis, tibi étiam plácitis mó¬</l><l xml:id="m-39fe71ae-f0a3-4fb0-b5c4-c37c9404faca" facs="#m-be66b156-553e-4085-b268-9317e5932865" label="lyrics-like">Second Postcommunion. Mundet et múniat. p. 502. Third at the priest'¬</l><l xml:id="m-fa4bb315-a8b5-4265-8289-ca47f8d90a5e" facs="#m-09d53493-1b8f-49fe-a165-bc019254863a" label="ambiguous">choice.</l><l xml:id="m-a64b41f8-bb94-4d33-9b74-a618a0161ee4" facs="#m-8f1635a6-340d-4117-9bf4-5f7811502639" label="text-like">AT SEXT.</l><l xml:id="m-79950ce5-1a30-4c8e-b256-71adeb33e7c4" facs="#m-95c98f88-657f-4e7b-87ab-7d5a1c19a977" label="ambiguous">Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-e005fcfe-c640-4290-ac90-a9ded19e621d" facs="#m-5683c006-e926-44c4-af58-e99b2a4d3fb6" label="ambiguous">8.e</l><l xml:id="m-63b31d72-8d2a-417f-9bf8-1bebe1cbde10" facs="#m-b503ac29-6c1f-4132-b9a9-4c51ca461671" label="ambiguous">S</l><l xml:id="m-937ba5db-57e6-413b-a0cc-19d6571ab80c" facs="#m-1a07faf3-6fe7-4df4-ace8-9839d22effff" label="lyrics-like">Emen cé-cidit" in térram bónam, et áttu-lit frú¬</l><l xml:id="m-e3c22955-45c8-44d7-be2c-6143c26ee822" facs="#m-f9073357-a3fe-4d7e-b333-e6138ba7f56b" label="lyrics-like">ctum, á-li-ud centé-simum, et á-li-ud sexagé-simum.</l><l xml:id="m-59987d37-a8cf-476f-8e45-7daade02fdc5" facs="#m-a7413e53-89c9-42b1-89e6-d132b256e1c2" label="ambiguous">E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-5d82991d-e341-4dfd-b99b-18aec42a0078" facs="#m-27122925-1dd6-4ad1-8d80-5039d52b3035" label="ambiguous">2 Cor. 11.f.</l><l xml:id="m-be156c1e-eaf2-4414-abf7-3fec390ddc2d" facs="#m-5389c7b2-17a5-40ce-a86c-6df7ffc3bced" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-94232417-fa07-4a6d-acc5-d2c92ffd6396" facs="#m-54f57aa5-4a9d-4c92-8447-3355188fcb0a" label="lyrics-like">TTIER virgis caesus sum, semel la- feci, *nocte et die in profúndo</l><l xml:id="m-404d4247-e82f-41c4-b0ce-d883aa4ecbd4" facs="#m-70110e01-d471-4e6a-939d-c86bf01a326a" label="lyrics-like">pidátus sum, ter naufrágium! maris fui.</l><l xml:id="m-5aed25c4-52fb-496f-9b6d-d41a2128ff62" facs="#m-57ba61c1-d57e-42e4-9390-422ac27e61f5" label="lyrics-like">Short Resp. In aetérnum. V. Dóminus régit me. p. 243.</l><l xml:id="m-bc5442c0-c91f-43ab-b4ad-9dcbd08f709b" facs="#m-8ec00eb2-fc4b-463b-9d7d-51be6b9f0d4b" label="text-like">AT NONE.</l><l xml:id="m-bb78ef4f-c4da-44b8-8800-3369ce12d249" facs="#m-21e4b224-2dbe-4525-839d-1095a3b8f8ab" label="ambiguous">Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-e67db2df-aded-4f98-a29b-cadeae58dc1f" facs="#m-94dd5f2c-0505-49d4-b58e-0f340cfc1bc6" label="ambiguous">7.e</l><l xml:id="m-8187899e-44ab-4648-84ee-a90627cc7489" facs="#m-b160f85c-6939-4c95-be4c-542dccf2050f" label="lyrics-like">Ivere, frâtres,“ dívi-tes ésse cúpi-tis, véras diví¬</l><l xml:id="m-b5a90889-c2ce-4eee-b85e-1007e100fce9" facs="#m-b10d13c9-6022-4fbb-b0d3-89fcd6bb5435" label="ambiguous">D</l><l xml:id="m-db539005-e901-499f-8747-7027b874745a" facs="#m-8a6de1c3-ad6b-4df8-bea6-907bfbce55b3" label="lyrics-like">ti-as amá-te. E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-1188cd21-18ba-4027-b1eb-8b662db8e383" facs="#m-b8a8c6ee-87d9-49ff-ad72-4f53035885aa" label="ambiguous">2 Cor. 12. c.</l><l xml:id="m-1c4aea52-6b03-49d0-a76f-343ceab501c0" facs="#m-e231111b-4e22-40c5-bb09-6f2e4706fbbd" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-724dbc37-063c-4a5a-b929-2b99231fb147" facs="#m-a22df6f8-dee9-498d-a01b-2a117b29181a" label="lyrics-like">Ibénter igitur gloriábor in infir-¡in me virtus Christi.</l><l xml:id="m-f69dbcd6-425c-4370-9900-fd9455cc525e" facs="#m-ab6d72a9-c71e-4d34-bb2d-9c54de0e2ecd" label="lyrics-like">II mitátibus meis,ut inhábitet</l><l xml:id="m-598697aa-5f1d-405b-b5e8-57341d683de6" facs="#m-e7587a25-1e28-4843-81f4-da109600114e" label="lyrics-like">Short Resp. Clamávi. Y. Ab occúltis. p. 247.</l><l xml:id="m-2375e09d-1dee-4e28-b4db-bf0795e74662" facs="#m-014ebaa3-6eeb-4fc3-a318-7d356ef3a236" label="text-like">AT VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-aab0f09f-06a8-42f6-b23f-782a2e35295f" facs="#m-d2ef3509-53ed-4406-8155-1bd067b21bed" label="text-like">Antiphons and Psalms of the Sunday, p. 251.</l><l xml:id="m-67f8e320-3c07-4fe7-bcaf-a2d52a00bf36" facs="#m-052eb933-202a-48c6-be6d-73b2b871f771" label="ambiguous">2 Cor. 1r. a.</l><l xml:id="m-96de99ce-0e89-46ae-b97d-bec344eb7f4e" facs="#m-e7fb68c2-bb47-4c2d-b0a3-e2228ccd097f" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-2358cb71-0211-4b45-8d29-38b08dac0450" facs="#m-c5b738ef-e04e-4c86-948d-9663bdc80e8a" label="lyrics-like">LVRatres: Libénter suffértis insi-[servitútem rédigit, si quis dévorat,</l><l xml:id="m-64bbe818-945d-4b71-b8ae-92dcf388df1f" facs="#m-25943a47-19ce-4e57-8327-038f3af16ca0" label="lyrics-like">piéntes, cum sitis ipsi sapién-[si quis áccipit, si quis extóllitur,</l><l xml:id="m-a20cec48-9f56-4bf0-90fb-8f84973341cd" facs="#m-162d106c-ea8d-46ea-bde7-65cc72b1a8ec" label="lyrics-like">tes : ! sustinétis enim si quis vos in l si quis in fáciem vos caedit.</l><l xml:id="m-46d1c135-1aa4-46f4-bd2f-0adc5d09ad61" facs="#m-be6b222d-0c7d-4663-8e8b-8d7a9b48d44a" label="lyrics-like">Hymn. Lu